===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# the act of [[genuflect]]ing
#* {{quote-text|en|year=1820|author={{w|Percy Bysshe Shelley}}|title=Oedipus Tyrannus; Or, Swellfoot The Tyrant: A Tragedy in Two Acts
|passage=Those impious Pigs,<br>Who, by frequent squeaks, have dared impugn<br>The settled Swellfoot system, or to make<br>Irreverent mockery of the '''genuflexions'''<br>Inculcated by the arch-priest, have been whipt<br>Into a loyal and an orthodox whine.}}

